OL,3,AUK prosecutors file for extradition of
OL,4,Athe Tate brothers from the US
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors in the UK have lodged a
OL,7,Fformal request for the extradition of
OL,8,Fbrothers Andrew and Tristan Tate from
OL,9,Fthe US to face charges of rape and sex
OL,10,Ftrafficking.
OL,12,FThe US State Department, which received
OL,13,Fthe requests last week, will review the
OL,14,Fextradition applications to make sure
OL,15,Fthey comply with the existing agreement
OL,16,Fbetween the US and UK.
OL,18,FBut the lawyer for the brothers, who
OL,19,Fare dual US-UK citizens, accused
OL,20,FBritish authorities of failing to
OL,21,Fprovide the necessary supporting
OL,22,Fdocuments in the request.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
