OL,3,AUK prosecutors file for extradition of
OL,4,Athe Tate brothers from the US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe brothers are facing a total of 59
OL,7,Fcharges in the UK, including rape and
OL,8,Fcounts relating to sex trafficking and
OL,9,Findecent images of a child. Both men
OL,10,Fdeny any wrongdoing.
